      "post_subject": "(Cambridge, MA) Amazing outdoor-facing holography exhibit",
      "content_md": "Hi - \n\nAn approximately 10-piece traveling collection of extraordinarily high-quality or historically-notable holograms on view OUTSIDE the MIT Museum. What I mean is, the holograms are mounted in the window, visible to passers-by at night. There are works from Yves Gentet, Zebra Imaging, the Media Lab, RabbitHoles and others. They are real treasures. My colleagues and I spent a very long time enjoying them. Through Apr 1:\n\n[http://web.mit.edu/museum/exhibitions/l ... ndows2011/](http://web.mit.edu/museum/exhibitions/luminouswindows2011/)\n\nEnjoy!\n\ngregg",
      "signature": "",
      "attachments": [],
      "quotes": [],
      "is_first_post": true,
      "url": "https://holographyforum.org/forum/viewtopic.php?p=1190#p1190"
